// which points at the remote-tracking branch for the remote's default
// branch.  Converting that target back to the corresponding branch in
// the remote repository therefore means replacing the
// `refs/remotes/<remote>/` prefix with `refs/heads/`.
// Other remote-tracking branches are converted in the same way,
// although they are handled closer to where they are enumerated.
